  room of the Silverjack building is taken over by a different artist\, vis
 ited by more than 2\,000 people a year. The 2027 guest curator is Danielle
  Krysa (The Jealous Curator).\n\nOrganisation: Ah Haa School for the Arts\
 nLocation: Ah Haa Silverjack building\, Telluride\, Colorado\, USA. In per
 son: artists must attend the install and the HAHA events through the week 
 of 12 to 19 July 2027. Open to local\, national and international artists.
 \nAward: All-inclusive budget of USD 1\,000 to 8\,000 per installation for
  materials\, shipping and production\, set case by case on experience\, ro
 om size and scope. Ah Haa also covers artist travel to and from Telluride 
 and provides accommodation for the week of 12 to 19 July 2027. NO separate
  artist fee or honorarium is stated. Entry fee USD 10.\nDuration: 1 week o
 n site (12 to 19 July 2027)\; public event 16 to 18 July 2027\n\nMore: htt
 ps://ahhaa.org/ah-haa-haha/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
